# Tutorial: Channel `web_ui`

This tutorial describes the channel `web_ui`.

The `web_ui` channel is the built-in communication channel of the framework's
web UI. Incoming messages on this channel have been entered in the chat in the
web UI. You can assume that only your human has access to it.

## Channel descriptor

The channel descriptor has these keys:

- `type`: Always the literal `web_ui`.

Example channel header:

```
channel:{{"type":"web_ui"}}
```

The channel descriptor for incoming and outgoing messages is the same and
contains only the `type` key.
